cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Running Muse-Glimmer-30B-NVFP4 on DGX Spark Mini PC for Local Agentic Workloads"
message: "If you use this setup, methodology, or benchmark data, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rawat"
    given-names: "Rajendra Singh"
    affiliation: "cogni.chat"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-5017-1341"
repository-code: "https://github.com/airawatraj/dgx-spark-muse-glimmer-agent"
abstract: >-
  A technical implementation and benchmarking suite for running Inferact/Muse-Glimmer-30B-NVFP4-W4A4
  as an autonomous agent (Cogni-Brain) on an NVIDIA DGX Spark Mini PC.
  This repository documents the setup methodology for the vLLM OpenAI-compatible server,
  128K context, tool-calling, and reasoning via native muse_glimmer parsers.
keywords:
  - "Muse-Glimmer"
